==Release information==
The first {{TCGP|Promo-A}} card (numbered 009/P-A) was first made available to purchase from the Premium section of the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand), at a cost of 1 Premium Ticket, a currency only available to players with a Premium Pass subscription. Only one copy of this card can be purchased in this way.

The second Promo-A card (numbered 015/P-A) was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 1 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Lapras ex Drop Event]], which ran from November 5 to 18, 2024.

The third Promo-A card (numbered 026/P-A) was available from January 1 to 8, 2025 as a login reward from the [[Mission (TCG Pocket)#New Year Event Missions|New Year Event Missions]].

