==Trivia==
This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} (026/P-A) illustration features {{p|Pikachu}}, {{p|Bulbasaur}}, {{p|Charmander}}, {{p|Squirtle}} and {{p|Eevee}}, all of which are [[first partner Pokémon]] in the [[Kanto]] region.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}, as was its '''Gnaw''' attack.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} (015/P-A) illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKthrough|Pikachu|48}} from the {{TCG|BREAKthrough}} expansion, which also has the Gnaw attack.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

